title: federal-regulations-mcp-server
abstract: "Search and trace US federal rules across the Federal Register (proposed/final rules and notices), the eCFR (codified, point-in-time CFR full text, locally mirrored), and Regulations.gov (rulemaking dockets and public comments) via MCP. STDIO or Streamable HTTP."
